ुँवरि जब देखौं","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"वृषभानु कुँवरि जब देखौं, तब जन्म सुफल करि लेव।मैं राधा राधा गाऊँ, राधा हित वेणु बजाऊँ॥ [1]मैं राधारमण कहाऊँ, काहे दूजो नाम धराऊँ।जहाँ राधा चर्चा कीजै, तहाँ प्रथम जान मोहि लीजै॥ [2]जहाँ राधा राधा गावै, तहाँ सुनवे को हम जावै।श्री राधा मेरी सम्पति, श्री राधा मेरी दम्पति॥ [3]श्री राधा मेरी सोभा, श्री राधा को चित लोभा।मैं राधा के संग नीको, राधा बिन लागत फीको॥ [4]","hindi_text":"श्री कृष्ण कहते हैं - जब भी मैं श्री वृषभानु नंदिनी श्री राधा का दर्शन करता हूँ, तब मैं अपने जीवन को पूर्ण और सार्थक मानता हूँ। मैं निरंतर “राधा-राधा” नाम का जप करता हूँ और उनकी प्रसन्नता के लिए ही अपनी मधुर मुरली बजाता हूँ। [1]\nमुझे ‘श्री राधा रमण’ कहा जाता है—क्योंकि मैं केवल श्री राधा के संग नित्य क्रीड़ाओं में रत रहता हूँ। मैं किसी अन्य नाम की अभिलाषा क्यों करूँ? जहाँ भी श्री राधा की लीलाओं का रसिक गान हो रहा हो, वहाँ का प्रथम श्रोता मुझे ही जानो। [2]\nजहाँ उनके गुणों का मधुर गान हो रहा हो, वहाँ मेरी उपस्थिति निश्चय मानो। श्री राधा ही मेरी सर्वस्व सम्पत्ति हैं और मेरी अनन्य नित्य-संगिनी हैं। [3]\nवे ही मेरी शोभा का आभूषण हैं, वे ही मेरे हृदय की परम अभिलाषा हैं। मैं जब श्री राधा के संग होता हूँ, तभी सब कुछ रमणीय लगता है; उनके बिना समस्त संसार फीका और शून्य प्रतीत होता है। [4]","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Śrī Kṛṣṇa says: Whenever I behold Śrī Vṛṣabhānu Nandinī Śrī Rādhey, I consider my life to be complete and meaningful. I continuously chant the name Rādha-Rādha and play my sweet flute solely for Her pleasure. [1]\nI am called Śrī Rādha Ramanan because I remain ever immersed in pastimes with Śrī Rādhey alone. Why would I desire any other name? Know me to be the first attendee wherever anyone is talking about Śrī Rādhā! [2]\nWherever Her glories are sweetly sung, consider my presence there as certain. Śrī Rādhey alone is my entire wealth and my unparalleled eternal companion. [3]\nShe alone is the ornament of my beauty, She alone is the supreme desire of my heart. Only when I am with Śrī Rādhey does everything appear delightful; without Her, the entire world seems dull and void. [4]","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5dabf1980384260060487b11/vrishbhanu-kunvari-jab-dekhaun-braj-rasik","author":"ब्रज रसिक","status":"published","content_text":"$5","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5dabf1980384260060487b11/vrishbhanu-kunvari-jab-dekhaun-braj-rasik","slug":"vrishabhanu-kunvari-jab-dekhaun"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children","$7","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"ne